<title>UK: HORSE RACING-SPRINT CUP RESULT.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-SPRINT CUP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>HAYDOCK, England 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the Group One</p>
<p>Haydock Park Sprint Cup for three-year-olds and upwards, run</p>
<p>over six furlongs (1.2 kms) on Saturday:</p>
<p>1. Iktamal 10-1 (ridden by Willie Ryan)</p>
<p>2. Blue Duster 9-1 (John Reid)</p>
<p>3. Catch The Blues 20-1 (Christy Roche)</p>
<p>11 ran. Miesque's Son 5-2 favourite</p>
<p>Distances: One length, half.</p>
<p>Winner owned by Maktoum Al Maktoum and trained in England by</p>
<p>Ed Dunlop.</p>
<p>Value to winning owner: 77,249 sterling ($121,000)</p>
</text>
